Cargo.lock binary

# Protocol capture samples used by the unit tests. Some contain XML text, so
# without this a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites their line
# endings and the byte-exact crypto tests fail.
*.bin binary
*.raw binary
*.pcapng binary
*.h264 binary

# Scripts run inside Linux (WSL, containers, CI) must keep LF endings even in
# a Windows checkout, or the shebang line breaks.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
